Still 1.2.0. Two fixes, both about what you hear.

Starting capture could make the audio go on-off-on. A route change arriving before the microphone had settled reported no input channels, which was read as the microphone being gone, so the session was re-activated for nothing. It only happened without a headset.

And the capture cues were transpositions of the connect cues. They now carry the three-bop countdown, and are no longer the quietest in the app.
